<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.4">
<l>patiṉāṟā māyiravar tēvimār</l>
<l rend="indent">paṇiceyya tuvarai yeṉṉum</l>
<l>atilnāya karākivīṟ ṟiruntama</l>
<l rend="indent">ṇavāḷar maṉṉu kōyil</l>
<l>putunāṇma larkkamala memperumāṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">poṉvayiṟṟil pūvē pōlvāṉ</l>
<l>potunāya kampāvit tiṟumāntu</l>
<l rend="indent">poṉcāykkum puṉala raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The eternal temple of the bridegroom</l>
<l rend="indent">who sits majestically as king</l>
<l rend="indent">in that [place] called Dvārakā</l>
<l rend="indent">while 16,000 queens do [him] service</l>
<l>is [in] Araṅkam on the water</l>
<l rend="indent">where the fresh lotus flowers stand tall,</l>
<l rend="indent">contemplating [his]universal sovereignty</l>
<l rend="indent">such that [they are] equal to the blossom</l>
<l rend="indent">in the golden navel of our Lord,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] bend [to give their] golden [pollen].</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
